<Page title="Add Event Request">
  <p>
    If your event belongs to one of the
    <a href="/organizations/">listed organizations</a>, add it to that
    organization's own Google Calendar — it appears on their page and on the
    homepage calendar automatically.
  </p>
  <p>Otherwise, to get your event onto the shared WCS MN community calendar:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Create a calendar event</li>
    <li>Invite minnesota.wcs@gmail.com to the event</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    If you experience any issues, please reach out through our
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Page>
